# This repository is public. The app's own source lives here; the data it
# carries — briefs, meetings, debriefs, contacts, passwords — never does.
# That data belongs in Supabase, behind the sign-in, and nowhere else.
#
# These rules are a backstop, not permission: anything holding real meeting
# or company data stays out of this repo whatever it is called.

# load scripts and database dumps
*.sql
*.dump
*.bak

# exports and working documents
*.csv
*.tsv
*.xls
*.xlsx
*.xlsm
*.doc
*.docx
*.pdf
*.ics
*.eml
*.msg

# data files (the app ships no .json of its own)
*.json

# a read-only snapshot carries the entire dataset in one file
EURETINA-2026-field-brief-*.html
*snapshot*.html

# credentials
.env
.env.*
*.pem
*.key
secrets*
